# RAX skill-library design reference

The executable-experience layout and lifecycle in `program_skills/` and
`src/manipulation_agent/program_*.py` refer to RAX's continual-learning,
experience-memory and autonomous-control skill documentation:
https://github.com/robot-agent-exploration/rax, commit
`db744f5950582c7c301f249192c0ed3c76517dd8`.
The implementation here is independently written for this Harness; no RAX
robot controller, simulator, assets or weights are bundled.

